/-!
# Exact relator replays for the P13 Hodge certificate

Every theorem below is checked solely in the free group as a finite
product of conjugates of the thirteen abstract P13 relators.  The
discovery matrix model and the replay-search program are not trusted
inputs.  The source JSON has SHA-256
`66255b59016bdeefd1fddd5de5069e5c32810543039f31da3930f43ce7cb5916`; Lean independently checks every emitted proof with `decide`.
-/

namespace GroupApproximation
namespace LiteralP13HodgeReplay

open LiteralP13Presentation PresentedGroupRelatorReplay
open FoxBoundary

noncomputable section

/-- Evaluation of a literal free word agrees with signed-word evaluation. -/
@[simp] theorem p13Word_word_eq_wordValue (letters : SignedWord P13Generator) :
    p13Word (word letters) = wordValue p13Generator letters := by
  change p13Word (word letters) =
    wordValue (fun i ↦ p13Word (FreeGroup.of i)) letters
  exact (wordValue_freeGroup_map p13Word letters).symm

